---
description: Telepathic Instruments visual system for all Resonant UI
globs: src/**/*.{tsx,css}
---

When building UI for this project, first run:
  designmdme --website <domain>

Then reference DESIGN-telepathic-instruments.md
for colors, typography, spacing, and component patterns.

Hard rules from that spec:
- Canvas `#e5e7eb`, cards `#ffffff`, text `#000000` / `#a3a3a3`
- One accent only: Solder Orange `#ff6c2f` — the single most important action
- Floating Deep Charcoal `#191919` pill nav, 64px radius
- Buttons and pills 9999px; cards 24px; inputs 2px
- No drop shadows. Flat surfaces.
- Suisse Intl → Inter. Suisse Intl Mono → JetBrains Mono, uppercase on chrome.
- Brand stays Resonant. No skip / next control.
